1	Nullable(String)
1.5	Nullable(String)
1.5	Nullable(String)
-- a declared column keeps its declared type contract and is read as before
2	Nullable(Int64)
3	Nullable(Int64)
-- an explicitly declared numeric type over an undeclared column is enforced the same way
